#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2333 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "No TSPARMCD=PDOSFRQ record anywhere in TS -> the 'Planned Dose Frequency' parameter is missing, one dataset-level finding. the near-miss parameter DOSFRQ is a proper substring of PDOSFRQ (and PCAEXFRQ shares the FRQ suffix), so a substring match on the filter would wrongly silence the rule."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | DOSFRQ   | Dose Frequency                             | QD
S01 | TS | 2 | PCAEXFRQ | Planned Challenge Agent Exposure Frequency | QD
S01 | TS | 3 | STITLE   | Nonclinical Study Title                    | 13-Week Repeat Dose Toxicity Study
